senses.gloss:
नि-√ ली Ā. -लीयते (rarely P., e.g. Pot. -लीयेत्), MBh. &c. or -ल॑यते, RV.; AV. (cf. नि-री; impf. -अलायत, TS.; pf. -लिल्ये, 3. pl. ˚यिरे, or ˚युर्, Br.; aor. -अलेष्ट, Br.; 3. pl. -अलेषत, Bhaṭṭ.; ind.p. -ला॑य, TBr.; -लीय, Hariv.; inf. -लेतुम्, Śiś.);
to settle down (esp. applied to the alighting of birds), alight, descend, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to become settled or fixed, Rājat. iii, 426;
to hide one's self, conceal one's self from (abl.), disappear, perish, RV.; &c.
